# Per-developer scratch — a working notebook, run logs, ideas not yet promoted,
# whatever your own tooling drops in the tree — is deliberately NOT listed here.
# It belongs to one clone, not to the project, so put it in that clone's own
# .git/info/exclude. Nothing committed may depend on any of it, and the
# committed record lives in docs/: requirements, decisions and research.
